<title>USA: USDA sponsors conference on Pacific Rim ag markets.</title>
<headline>USDA sponsors conference on Pacific Rim ag markets.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Monday said it will sponsor a conference on how to successfully export agricultural products to China/Hong Kong, Indonesia, Malaysia, Thailand and the Philippines.</p>
<p>The conference, called &quot;Feeding the New Dragons,&quot; is slated for May 11-13 in Long Beach, Calif. It is jointly sponsored by USDA's Agricultural Marketing Service, the United Agribusiness League and the Port of Long Beach.</p>
